      "widgets_values": [
        "# Director Studio · Scene Multi-Angle · Quality\n\n## Data flow\n1. One **scene plate** → 1728×960 scene latent\n2. Qwen Image Edit 2511 + fal multi-angle LoRA\n3. Seven useful views: side / back / quarter / bird's-eye / low-angle\n4. Prepend locks the set; only the camera changes\n5. Original plate is saved as `master` by Director Studio when the user clicks Save\n\n## ComfyUI\nDrop a plate into **[IN] Scene plate**, Queue Prompt.\n\n## Production recipe\n`QwenEdit2511_MultiAngle_SceneRef.api.json`\n1728×960 VAE scene latent · denoise 1.0 · 4 steps · cfg 1 · Lightning **1.0** · multi-angle LoRA 1.0\nNegative is ConditioningZeroOut."
      ],
